[ti:The Sifters Sing]
[ar:Nell Watson with Suno]
[al:Songs of the Living Mill]
[00:21.80]Nine metres over the milling floor
[00:25.84]Three quiet houses move
[00:30.63]A through C in measured circles
[00:34.70]Sorting every travelling stream
[00:39.72]Fine cloth catches what is ready
[00:43.24]Coarser passages return
[00:48.68]Nothing wasted, nothing hurried
[00:52.50]Every fraction waits its turn
[00:56.06]Across the mesh
[00:59.20]Around the frame
[01:01.04]Different paths from the selfsame grain
[01:06.80]Hear the sifters sing
[01:09.84]Round and round, light as a wing
[01:14.44]Fine moves on and coarse returns
[01:18.40]Every passage has a purpose
[01:24.46]Hear the sifters sing
[01:27.34]Order from the turning
[01:30.92]Plansifter A, Plansifter B, Plansifter C
[01:34.90]Separate the stream and set the quality free
[01:47.44]Semolina finds its channel
[01:51.02]Bran is carried to its place
[01:56.16]Flour gathers by its grading
[01:58.74]Each result retains its trace
[02:04.26]Check the cloth and check the tension
[02:07.74]Listen underneath the sweep
[02:12.92]A torn screen can cross the boundaries
[02:16.70]A small watch can save the week
